<p>Jawan Betay Ko Aghosh Main Uthaye Huwe&nbsp;<br> Hussain Khak Pe Bethay Hain Sar Jhukaye Huwe&nbsp;</p> 
<p>Aulad Agar Hoti Teri Mera Dard Samjhta Tu Akbar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>Ek Lash e Jawa'n Pe Ek Baba&nbsp;<br> Deta Tha Sada Yeh Ro Ro Kar</p> 
<p>1) Na Khud Ko Sambhala Jata Hai Na Tujh Ko Sambhala Jata Hai<br> Tujhe Kya Maloom Jawa'n Beta Kis Tarha Se Pala Jata Hai&nbsp;<br> Girta Hu Kabhe Main Uthta Hoon<br> Jaonga Tujhe Kesy Lekar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>2) Laila Se Ye Keh Kar Aya Hu Akbar Ne Bulaya Hai Mujhko&nbsp;<br> Tum Maa Ho Dua Mango Usne Seene Pe Na Barchi Khai Ho&nbsp;<br> Jene Ke Duain Karti Hai Khaimay Main Teri Maa Ro Ro Kar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>3) Athara Baras Tujh Ko Apne Seene Se Lagaya Hai Main Ne&nbsp;<br> Tery Sath Apny Armano Ko Parwan Chadhaya Hai Main Ne&nbsp;<br> Arman Tha Meri Mayyat Ko&nbsp;<br> Kandhay Pe Uthaye Tu Akbar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>4) Akbar Meri Zainab Kay Dil Main Armaan Tha Teri Shadi Ka<br> Aye Kash Wo Tere Mathay Pe Ek Bar Saja Leti Sehra&nbsp;<br> Bandhna Tha Jahan Per Haye Sehra&nbsp;<br> Hai Khoon Tery Us Mathay Per</p> 
<p>5) Is Baat Pe Rona Ata Hai Mere Sath Agar Aati Sughra&nbsp;<br> Awaz Teri Sun Kar Ran Mein Tujhe Dhundne Ajati Sughra&nbsp;<br> Teri Lash Pe Aker Mar Jati&nbsp;<br> Sughra Bhaiya Bhaiya Keh Kar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>6) Jitna Main Ghareeb Hu Aye Akbar Koi Baap Ghareeb Na Ho Itna&nbsp;<br> Pani Khud Manga Tha Tu Ne Pyasa Tha Na Jane Kitna&nbsp;<br> Tere Kehne Per Bhi Main Tujh Ko&nbsp;<br> Pani Na Pila Paya Dilbar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>7) Yeh Akhri Khwahish Hai Meri Sajjad Se Keh Dunga Ja kar&nbsp;<br> Jab Bara Muharram Ko Wo Sab Kay Lashon Ko Dafanaye Aakar&nbsp;<br> Mere Pehlu Main Tum Ko Dafna De&nbsp;<br> Kabhi Door Na Ho Mujh Se Akbar<br> &nbsp;<br> 8) Asan Nahi Hai Yeh Lamha Us Waqt Bataya Tha Main Ne&nbsp;<br> Tere Samne Hurr Ke Betay Ka Jab Lasha Uthaya Tha Main Ne&nbsp;<br> Aulad Ka Gham Kya Hota Hai&nbsp;<br> Pooche Yeh Koi Mujh Se Aakar&nbsp;</p> 
<p>9) Kandhay Pe Jawa'n Lasha Lekar Jab Khaimo'n Tak Pohche Mola&nbsp;<br> Zeeshan o Raza Yeh Kehte Hue Chuma Ali Akbar Ka Chehra&nbsp;<br> Teri Lash Utha Kar Kis Tarha&nbsp;<br> Jaoon Main Khaimon Kay Andar</p>